      STR_GJR_TRAIT_ACE: "Ace"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_ACE_DESC: "Craft he flies hit harder and dodge more in interceptions."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_AIRBORNE: "Paradrop"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_AIRBORNE_DESC: "Can deploy away from the landing zone."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_BARONESS: "Spy"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_BARONESS_DESC: "Starts the battle hidden."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_BEACH_HEAD: "Ranger Conditioning"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_BEACH_HEAD_DESC: "Never runs out of wind."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_BIG_BOA: "Drill Instructor"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_BIG_BOA_DESC: "Nearby Cobra troops don't panic."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_BREAKER: "Radio Net"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_BREAKER_DESC: "Cobra a Joe has spotted stay marked for one turn after every Joe loses sight of them: nothing vanishes into the fog to ambush the squad."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_BUZZER: "Mean"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_BUZZER_DESC: "Keeps fighting while wounded."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_CLUTCH: "Grease Monkey"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_CLUTCH_DESC: "A Joe vehicle next to him patches itself up each turn."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_COBRA_COMMANDER: "Coward"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_COBRA_COMMANDER_DESC: "Withdraws when hurt and always escapes."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_COPPERHEAD: "Swamp Rat"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_COPPERHEAD_DESC: "No penalty in swamp, river or shallow water."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_CROC_MASTER: "Warden"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_CROC_MASTER_DESC: "Prisoners in his compounds don't escape."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_CRYSTAL_BALL: "Interrogator"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_CRYSTAL_BALL_DESC: "Captured Joes give up intel faster."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_DEEP_SIX: "Deep Pressure"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_DEEP_SIX_DESC: "Slow and steady; nothing rattles him."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_DESTRO: "Honor"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_DESTRO_DESC: "Never fires on a downed Joe and keeps his deals."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_DOC: "Battlefield Surgeon"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_DOC_DESC: "Revives a downed Joe in one action with more health."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_DR_MINDBENDER: "Mad Scientist"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_DR_MINDBENDER_DESC: "B.A.T.s and engineered troops near him fight better."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_DUKE: "Field Leadership"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_DUKE_DESC: "Joes near him hold their nerve and aim better."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_FIREFLY: "Saboteur"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_FIREFLY_DESC: "His explosives always start fires."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_FLASH: "Laser Rifle"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_FLASH_DESC: "One of two Joes, with Grand Slam, carrying an energy weapon from Day 1."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_GNAWGAHYDE: "Poacher"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_GNAWGAHYDE_DESC: "Tracks wounded Joes."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_GRAND_SLAM: "Long Shot"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_GRAND_SLAM_DESC: "His laser's long shots don't lose accuracy with distance."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_GRUNT: "Steady"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_GRUNT_DESC: "Strong reaction fire; the dependable rifleman."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_HAWK: "Command Post"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_HAWK_DESC: "When he deploys, Cobra positions are revealed for the first turn."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_MAJOR_BLUDD: "Grudge"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_MAJOR_BLUDD_DESC: "Bonus damage against Joes on his marked list."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_MONKEYWRENCH: "Demolitions"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_MONKEYWRENCH_DESC: "His grenades break walls."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_OVERKILL: "Cyborg"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_OVERKILL_DESC: "Immune to stun and gas."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_RAPTOR: "Falconer"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_RAPTOR_DESC: "His bird extends his sight range."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_RIPPER: "Brute"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_RIPPER_DESC: "Bonus damage at close range."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_ROADBLOCK: ".50 Cal Suppression"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_ROADBLOCK_DESC: "A burst pins the target, cutting its next turn's actions."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_ROAD_PIG: "Berserk"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_ROAD_PIG_DESC: "Gets stronger as he takes damage."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_ROCK_N_ROLL: "Sustained Fire"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_ROCK_N_ROLL_DESC: "Longer machine-gun bursts."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_SCARLETT: "Crossbow"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_SCARLETT_DESC: "Silent shots that don't give away her position."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_SCRAP_IRON: "Tank Hunter"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_SCRAP_IRON_DESC: "Bonus damage against vehicles."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_SERPENTOR: "Arrogant"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_SERPENTOR_DESC: "Leads from the front and won't retreat until badly hurt."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_SGT_SLAUGHTER: "Parade-Ground Voice"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_SGT_SLAUGHTER_DESC: "Joes near him hold their nerve."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_SHORT_FUZE: "Mortar"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_SHORT_FUZE_DESC: "Indirect fire over cover."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_SNAKE_EYES: "Silent Killer"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_SNAKE_EYES_DESC: "Moves silently; melee kills don't alert nearby Cobra. With Timber, his wolf, who scouts and fights beside him."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_STALKER: "Ranger Lead"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_STALKER_DESC: "His squad gets extra movement on the first turn."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_STORM_SHADOW_COBRA: "Silent"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_STORM_SHADOW_COBRA_DESC: "Attacks don't reveal his position."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_THRASHER: "Road Rage"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_THRASHER_DESC: "His vehicle moves farther."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_TOMAX: "Twin Bond"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_TOMAX_DESC: "If one goes down, the other rages and tries to carry him off."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_TORCH: "Firebug"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_TORCH_DESC: "His fire spreads faster."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_TORPEDO: "Frogman"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_TORPEDO_DESC: "Swims like he walks. Charges set by him go off harder."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_WET_SUIT: "Wet Feet Only"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_WET_SUIT_DESC: "Faster and sharper near water, short-tempered away from it."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_WILD_WEASEL: "Ground Attack"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_WILD_WEASEL_DESC: "Strikes hit harder against ground targets."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_XAMOT: "Twin Bond"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_XAMOT_DESC: "If one goes down, the other rages and tries to carry him off."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_ZANDAR: "Camouflage"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_ZANDAR_DESC: "Hard to spot outdoors."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_ZANZIBAR: "Skiff-Borne"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_ZANZIBAR_DESC: "He flies, the only Cobra on the board who does, so walls, water and rooftops are nothing to him; his raids on civilian shipping earn Cobra double."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_ZAP: "Bazooka"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_ZAP_DESC: "Extra damage against plating and vehicles."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_ZARANA: "Spy"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_ZARANA_DESC: "Starts the battle hidden."
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_ZARTAN: "Chameleon"
      STR_GJR_TRAIT_ZARTAN_DESC: "Harder to see in shadow and cover."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ACE_DEPLOY: "Deal me in."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ACE_DOWN: "Get me back in a cockpit."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ACE_HIT: "Just a scratch on the paint."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ACE_KILL: "Splash one."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ACE_MOVE: "Watch this."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ACE_ORDER: "Taxiing."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_AIRBORNE_DEPLOY: "Green light."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_AIRBORNE_DOWN: "Go on. I'll catch up."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_AIRBORNE_HIT: "Hit. Keep going."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_AIRBORNE_KILL: "Target down."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_AIRBORNE_MOVE: "Look up."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_AIRBORNE_ORDER: "Moving."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BARONESS_DEPLOY: "Let us make this quick, darlings."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BARONESS_DOWN: "This isn't finished. Not by half."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BARONESS_HIT: "You'll regret that, Joe."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BARONESS_KILL: "How tedious."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BARONESS_MOVE: "Darling, you never stood a chance."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BARONESS_ORDER: "Do try to keep up."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BEACH_HEAD_DEPLOY: "Move it! You can rest when you're dead!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BEACH_HEAD_DOWN: "Get up, Ranger... get up..."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BEACH_HEAD_HIT: "Pain is weakness leaving the body!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BEACH_HEAD_KILL: "That's what a hundred push-ups a day gets you."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BEACH_HEAD_MOVE: "Again. Faster."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BEACH_HEAD_ORDER: "On the double!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BIG_BOA_DEPLOY: "Fall in, maggots!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BIG_BOA_DOWN: "Ring the bell... I'm done."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BIG_BOA_HIT: "That all you got?"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BIG_BOA_KILL: "Down for the count."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BIG_BOA_MOVE: "Get up. I'm not done with you."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BIG_BOA_ORDER: "Move it! MOVE IT!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BREAKER_DEPLOY: "Comms are up."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BREAKER_DOWN: "Somebody grab the radio!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BREAKER_HIT: "Hit! Radio's fine."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BREAKER_KILL: "Scratch one."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BREAKER_MOVE: "If they're talking, I'm listening."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BREAKER_ORDER: "On the move, still on channel."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BUZZER_DEPLOY: "Right then. Who's first?"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BUZZER_DOWN: "This ain't over, you lot!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BUZZER_HIT: "Oi! That's me good arm!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BUZZER_KILL: "Ha! Next!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BUZZER_MOVE: "Mind if I cut in?"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_BUZZER_ORDER: "Make a hole!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_CLUTCH_DEPLOY: "Who's driving? Me. I'm driving."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_CLUTCH_DOWN: "Somebody... keep the engine warm."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_CLUTCH_HIT: "Ow! That's coming out of somebody's paycheck!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_CLUTCH_KILL: "Should've changed your oil, pal."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_CLUTCH_MOVE: "Keys are optional."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_CLUTCH_ORDER: "Yeah, yeah, I heard ya."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_COBRA_COMMANDER_DEPLOY: "Cobra! Destroy them all!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_COBRA_COMMANDER_DOWN: "This isn't over, Joes! It's never over!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_COBRA_COMMANDER_HIT: "I've been shot! Somebody do something!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_COBRA_COMMANDER_KILL: "Hah! Another one for the snake pit!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_COBRA_COMMANDER_MOVE: "Retreat! Retreat! This is not my fault!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_COBRA_COMMANDER_ORDER: "Fools! Must I do everything myself?"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_COPPERHEAD_DEPLOY: "Swamp's mine, boys."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_COPPERHEAD_DOWN: "Swamp'll get you before I do."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_COPPERHEAD_HIT: "Dang! That smarts!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_COPPERHEAD_KILL: "Gator bait."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_COPPERHEAD_MOVE: "The swamp's mine. You're just visiting."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_COPPERHEAD_ORDER: "Into the water. Move!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_CROC_MASTER_DEPLOY: "My pets are hungry."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_CROC_MASTER_DOWN: "My crocs... will remember you."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_CROC_MASTER_HIT: "You'll pay for that, Joe!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_CROC_MASTER_KILL: "Feeding time."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_CROC_MASTER_MOVE: "My pets are hungry."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_CROC_MASTER_ORDER: "Into the water with them!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_CRYSTAL_BALL_DEPLOY: "Look into my eyes, Joe."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_CRYSTAL_BALL_DOWN: "I saw this ending... I ignored it."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_CRYSTAL_BALL_HIT: "Unforeseen. How rude."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_CRYSTAL_BALL_KILL: "You never saw it coming."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_CRYSTAL_BALL_MOVE: "Look into the light. Deeper."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_CRYSTAL_BALL_ORDER: "Let them come to me."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DEEP_SIX_DEPLOY: "..."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DEEP_SIX_DOWN: "...quiet down here."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DEEP_SIX_HIT: "Hm."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DEEP_SIX_KILL: "..."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DEEP_SIX_MOVE: "It's peaceful down there. Until I get to work."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DEEP_SIX_ORDER: "Mm."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DESTRO_DEPLOY: "Gentlemen, let us conclude our business."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DESTRO_DOWN: "We will meet again, on better terms. Mine."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DESTRO_HIT: "Impressive. You will regret it."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DESTRO_KILL: "A worthy opponent. Pity."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DESTRO_MOVE: "War is a business. I am very good at business."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DESTRO_ORDER: "Proceed. Efficiently."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DOC_DEPLOY: "Medic up. Who needs me?"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DOC_DOWN: "Keep pressure on it. You know what to do."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DOC_HIT: "I'm fine. Help him first."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DOC_KILL: "[he does not celebrate]"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DOC_MOVE: "Stay down. I'm coming to you."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DOC_ORDER: "Coming through."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DR_MINDBENDER_DEPLOY: "Science waits for no one. Proceed."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DR_MINDBENDER_DOWN: "Fascinating... I must take notes... later."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DR_MINDBENDER_HIT: "My work! You'll ruin my work!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DR_MINDBENDER_KILL: "A disappointing specimen."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DR_MINDBENDER_MOVE: "Your mind belongs to me now."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DR_MINDBENDER_ORDER: "Test subjects, forward!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DUKE_DEPLOY: "Spread out. Eyes open. Nobody's a hero today."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DUKE_DOWN: "Get the squad out. That's an order."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DUKE_HIT: "Just a scratch. Keep moving."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DUKE_KILL: "Target down. Next."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DUKE_MOVE: "Yo Joe! On me!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_DUKE_ORDER: "Move. I've got your back."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_FIREFLY_DEPLOY: "Contract accepted."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_FIREFLY_DOWN: "Check your floor before you step, Joe."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_FIREFLY_HIT: "Careless of me."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_FIREFLY_KILL: "Bang."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_FIREFLY_MOVE: "You'll never see me. You'll only hear the bang."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_FIREFLY_ORDER: "Clear the blast zone. Or don't."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_FLASH_DEPLOY: "Battery's full."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_FLASH_DOWN: "Don't let them take the rifle."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_FLASH_HIT: "Hey! That's my good side."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_FLASH_KILL: "Lights out."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_FLASH_MOVE: "Overcharging. Stand back."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_FLASH_ORDER: "Moving. Mind the cable."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_GNAWGAHYDE_DEPLOY: "Good hunting today."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_GNAWGAHYDE_DOWN: "Boars! Get me outta here!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_GNAWGAHYDE_HIT: "Ow! That ain't sporting!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_GNAWGAHYDE_KILL: "Bagged one!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_GNAWGAHYDE_MOVE: "Somethin's bleedin'. I can smell it."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_GNAWGAHYDE_ORDER: "Flush 'em out, boys!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_GRAND_SLAM_DEPLOY: "Coordinates logged."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_GRAND_SLAM_DOWN: "Jet pack's done. So am I."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_GRAND_SLAM_HIT: "Hit. Still airborne."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_GRAND_SLAM_KILL: "Splash one."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_GRAND_SLAM_MOVE: "Range is just a question of how far you jump."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_GRAND_SLAM_ORDER: "Plotting a route. A high one."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_GRUNT_DEPLOY: "In position."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_GRUNT_DOWN: "Hold the line without me."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_GRUNT_HIT: "I'm hit. Still shooting."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_GRUNT_KILL: "Got him."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_GRUNT_MOVE: "I've got you covered. All of you."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_GRUNT_ORDER: "Moving up."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_HAWK_DEPLOY: "Positions. We go on my mark."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_HAWK_DOWN: "Duke has command."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_HAWK_HIT: "I'm fine. Stay on task."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_HAWK_KILL: "One less."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_HAWK_MOVE: "Fire mission, grid follows. Make it count."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_HAWK_ORDER: "Execute."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_MAJOR_BLUDD_DEPLOY: "Another day, another contract."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_MAJOR_BLUDD_DOWN: "I'll remember your face, Joe. I always do."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_MAJOR_BLUDD_HIT: "You'll pay for that, mate. In full."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_MAJOR_BLUDD_KILL: "Scratch one off the list."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_MAJOR_BLUDD_MOVE: "Everyone has a price. Yours just went up."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_MAJOR_BLUDD_ORDER: "Earn your pay, maggots."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_MONKEYWRENCH_DEPLOY: "Who wants a present?"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_MONKEYWRENCH_DOWN: "I'm out! Save me a grenade!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_MONKEYWRENCH_HIT: "Oi! Watch it!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_MONKEYWRENCH_KILL: "Boom! Ha!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_MONKEYWRENCH_MOVE: "Catch!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_MONKEYWRENCH_ORDER: "Blow it up! Blow it all up!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_OVERKILL_DEPLOY: "UNITS. DEPLOY."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_OVERKILL_DOWN: "SYSTEMS... FAILING... RETREAT."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_OVERKILL_HIT: "DAMAGE REGISTERED. CONTINUING."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_OVERKILL_KILL: "TARGET TERMINATED."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_OVERKILL_MOVE: "Machines don't fear. Neither do I."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_OVERKILL_ORDER: "ELIMINATE ALL TARGETS."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_RAPTOR_DEPLOY: "My falcon sees all."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_RAPTOR_DOWN: "Fly, my falcon! Fly!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_RAPTOR_HIT: "Ah! My feathers!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_RAPTOR_KILL: "Prey."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_RAPTOR_MOVE: "My falcon sees everything."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_RAPTOR_ORDER: "Hunt them down!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_RIPPER_DEPLOY: "Let's tear something open."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_RIPPER_DOWN: "Get me outta here!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_RIPPER_HIT: "That tickled!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_RIPPER_KILL: "Crunch."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_RIPPER_MOVE: "What's inside? Let's find out."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_RIPPER_ORDER: "Grab 'em!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ROADBLOCK_DEPLOY: "Set me down somewhere with a view."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ROADBLOCK_DOWN: "Somebody watch my stew."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ROADBLOCK_HIT: "That's gonna leave a mark."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ROADBLOCK_KILL: "Should've stayed home."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ROADBLOCK_MOVE: "Full belt, coming through!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ROADBLOCK_ORDER: "Rollin'. Slowly."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ROAD_PIG_DEPLOY: "Smash!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ROAD_PIG_DOWN: "Road Pig... sleep now."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ROAD_PIG_HIT: "Road Pig ANGRY!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ROAD_PIG_KILL: "Squashed."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ROAD_PIG_MOVE: "Smash it all!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ROAD_PIG_ORDER: "SMASH 'EM!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ROCK_N_ROLL_DEPLOY: "Let's make some noise."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ROCK_N_ROLL_DOWN: "Somebody keep that gun warm."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ROCK_N_ROLL_HIT: "Ow. Rude."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ROCK_N_ROLL_KILL: "Wipeout."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ROCK_N_ROLL_MOVE: "Rock and roll!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ROCK_N_ROLL_ORDER: "Moving. Try to keep up."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SCARLETT_DEPLOY: "Eyes on. Nobody's seen me."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SCARLETT_DOWN: "Get the intel out. Not me. The intel."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SCARLETT_HIT: "Hit. I've had worse."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SCARLETT_KILL: "Down. Not a sound."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SCARLETT_MOVE: "Three bolts. Three problems solved."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SCARLETT_ORDER: "Moving. Quietly."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SCRAP_IRON_DEPLOY: "Bring me something with armour."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SCRAP_IRON_DOWN: "Next time, I bring a bigger one."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SCRAP_IRON_HIT: "Not the face. Not the launcher."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SCRAP_IRON_KILL: "Scrap."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SCRAP_IRON_MOVE: "Every vehicle has a weak spot. I find it."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SCRAP_IRON_ORDER: "Clear my line of fire."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SERPENTOR_DEPLOY: "Kneel before Serpentor!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SERPENTOR_DOWN: "This is not defeat. It is a lesson."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SERPENTOR_HIT: "You dare strike your emperor?"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SERPENTOR_KILL: "So falls every enemy of Cobra."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SERPENTOR_MOVE: "Kneel before your emperor!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SERPENTOR_ORDER: "Cobra! Your emperor commands you!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SGT_SLAUGHTER_DEPLOY: "Listen up, maggots! This is my course now!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SGT_SLAUGHTER_DOWN: "I'll be back... and you'll be doing laps!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SGT_SLAUGHTER_HIT: "Is that all you got?!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SGT_SLAUGHTER_KILL: "Dismissed!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SGT_SLAUGHTER_MOVE: "Get up, maggot! You're a Joe now!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SGT_SLAUGHTER_ORDER: "You call that hustle?!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SHORT_FUZE_DEPLOY: "Baseplate down."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SHORT_FUZE_DOWN: "Somebody spot for me."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SHORT_FUZE_HIT: "Watch it, I'm holding explosives."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SHORT_FUZE_KILL: "On target."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SHORT_FUZE_MOVE: "Walking it in. Heads down."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SHORT_FUZE_ORDER: "Relocating the tube."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SNAKE_EYES_DEPLOY: "[signals: two fingers, then forward]"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SNAKE_EYES_DOWN: "[Timber stands over him]"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SNAKE_EYES_HIT: "[says nothing]"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SNAKE_EYES_KILL: "[sheathes the sword]"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SNAKE_EYES_MOVE: "[Timber's growl, then nothing]"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_SNAKE_EYES_ORDER: "[a nod]"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_STALKER_DEPLOY: "Rangers lead the way."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_STALKER_DOWN: "Get them home, Grunt."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_STALKER_HIT: "Took one. Keep moving."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_STALKER_KILL: "Clear."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_STALKER_MOVE: "We were here first."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_STALKER_ORDER: "Low and quiet. Go."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_STORM_SHADOW_COBRA_DEPLOY: "[bows once, then is gone]"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_STORM_SHADOW_COBRA_DOWN: "This is not the end of it, brother."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_STORM_SHADOW_COBRA_HIT: "A worthy cut."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_STORM_SHADOW_COBRA_KILL: "The Arashikage remember."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_STORM_SHADOW_COBRA_MOVE: "I serve Cobra. For now."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_STORM_SHADOW_COBRA_ORDER: "Move without sound."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_THRASHER_DEPLOY: "Gas it!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_THRASHER_DOWN: "She's dead! The machine's dead!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_THRASHER_HIT: "Not the paint job!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_THRASHER_KILL: "Roadkill!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_THRASHER_MOVE: "Out of my way!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_THRASHER_ORDER: "Run 'em down!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_TOMAX_DEPLOY: "Shall we, brother?"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_TOMAX_DOWN: "Brother - get clear!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_TOMAX_HIT: "Xamot... I felt that."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_TOMAX_KILL: "One less, brother."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_TOMAX_MOVE: "We are always two steps ahead. Together."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_TOMAX_ORDER: "Our way. As always."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_TORCH_DEPLOY: "Who wants it warm?"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_TORCH_DOWN: "Hot hot hot - I'm out!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_TORCH_HIT: "Ow! Watch the tank!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_TORCH_KILL: "Toasty."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_TORCH_MOVE: "It's getting warm in here."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_TORCH_ORDER: "Light 'em up!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_TORPEDO_DEPLOY: "Water's warm. Let's go."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_TORPEDO_DOWN: "Get me back to the water..."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_TORPEDO_HIT: "Ow! That stung worse than a jellyfish."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_TORPEDO_KILL: "Sleep with the fishes, bruddah."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_TORPEDO_MOVE: "See you on the bottom."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_TORPEDO_ORDER: "Aye, aye."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_WET_SUIT_DEPLOY: "Dry land. Great. My favourite."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_WET_SUIT_DOWN: "Tell 'em... I wanted a burial at sea..."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_WET_SUIT_HIT: "Agh! I'm leaking!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_WET_SUIT_KILL: "Shark bait."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_WET_SUIT_MOVE: "Water's fine. Come on in."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_WET_SUIT_ORDER: "Yeah, yeah, hooyah."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_WILD_WEASEL_DEPLOY: "Weasel's in the air!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_WILD_WEASEL_DOWN: "Bailing! Bailing out!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_WILD_WEASEL_HIT: "Eh! Who scratched my paint?"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_WILD_WEASEL_KILL: "Splash one Joe!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_WILD_WEASEL_MOVE: "Low and fast. That's the only way to fly."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_WILD_WEASEL_ORDER: "Low and fast. Let's go."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_XAMOT_DEPLOY: "We go together, brother."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_XAMOT_DOWN: "Brother - leave me!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_XAMOT_HIT: "Tomax... we are hurt."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_XAMOT_KILL: "Two steps ahead."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_XAMOT_MOVE: "We are always two steps ahead. Together."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_XAMOT_ORDER: "As one. Now."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZANDAR_DEPLOY: "You won't see me, Joe."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZANDAR_DOWN: "Smoke... I need smoke!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZANDAR_HIT: "Blast! Where'd that come from?"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZANDAR_KILL: "Clean shot."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZANDAR_MOVE: "Now you see me..."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZANDAR_ORDER: "Spread out. Stay low."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZANZIBAR_DEPLOY: "Arr! Prize ahoy!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZANZIBAR_DOWN: "Abandon ship!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZANZIBAR_HIT: "Shiver me... ow!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZANZIBAR_KILL: "Walk the plank!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZANZIBAR_MOVE: "Arr! Everything here is mine!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZANZIBAR_ORDER: "Board 'em, lads!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZAP_DEPLOY: "Who ordered the big one?"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZAP_DOWN: "Bazooka's yours. Use it well."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZAP_HIT: "Okay, that one stung."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZAP_KILL: "That wall had it coming."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZAP_MOVE: "Fire in the hole!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZAP_ORDER: "Moving. Mind the backblast."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZARANA_DEPLOY: "Nobody notices a pretty face."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZARANA_DOWN: "Zartan will hear about this!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZARANA_HIT: "You'll regret that, mate."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZARANA_KILL: "Too easy."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZARANA_MOVE: "You never knew it was me."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZARANA_ORDER: "Dreadnoks, with me!"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZARTAN_DEPLOY: "Nobody sees me coming. Not even you."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZARTAN_DOWN: "You'll see me again. You just won't know it."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZARTAN_HIT: "Lucky shot. Your last."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZARTAN_KILL: "Never knew it was me."
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZARTAN_MOVE: "Who do you think I am?"
      STR_GJR_VOICE_ZARTAN_ORDER: "Dreadnoks! Earn your keep!"
